# Daily workflow v2 (run_daily_workflow_v2.py via cli/run_workflow_job.py).
# Copy to crontab on the server if Flask/Gunicorn is not running 24/7.
#
# Default in-app schedule: 09:00 Asia/Jerusalem (DAILY_WORKFLOW_SCHEDULER_*).
# Skips when already running or a successful run already started today.
# Status: runtime/workflow_runs/daily.json
#
# 0 9 * * * cd /path/to/KLblend && /usr/bin/python3 cli/run_daily_workflow_scheduled.py >> runtime/logs/daily_workflow_scheduled.log 2>&1
